&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=x4hxHvjF7VwQ7kNvwHosd7g&_nc_oc=Adr71DIHKqtKLEp0YDHdjfRJ4KMvfufX2Sn-YNSlNssu8sZn9WywI2KPppnBK-cQyEM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSzAxhVsV6DizZnZi3n3pP4TUz-T9k2wLCX4vAs8ukwKw&oe=6B0C7646"}, "display_name": "BrickVR", "keywords": ["brick", "brickvisual", "brickvr", "brickvisualvr", "360"], "long_description": "Brick VR is a the next step to communicating architecture.\n\nBrick VR allows you to discover unbuilt architecture. You can step into a large scale development project or an exclusive condo to experience the feeling of the presence. The application developed by Brick Visual, a world famous architectural visualization company. It is a panoramic 360 viewer application with the following features:\n- Share the VR experience live\n- Navigate by hotspots or layout\n- Choose between different interior design styles or different architectural phases\n- Choose between different time of the day\n \nVisit brickvisualvr.com to find out more about the VR solutions of Brick Visual.", "short_description": "Brick VR is a the next step to communicating architecture.\n\nBrick VR allows you to discover unbuilt architecture. You can step into a large scale development project or an exclusive condo, to experience the feeling of the presence. It is a panoramic 360 viewer application with extended features, such as live sharing, style chooser, time of the day chooser.\nVisit brickvisualvr.com to find out more about the VR solutions of Brick Visual."}]}, "developer_name": "Zsolt Simon", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://brickvisualvr.com/brick-vr-application-privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://brickvisualvr.com/brick-vr-application-terms-of-service/", "publisher_name": "Brickvisual", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://brickvisualvr.com/static-360-vr/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": []